WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:37.810
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.040
Talk about a false alarm.

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:34.240
Rebecca and Leon were having a great match.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.240
But we arrived late because of Grandpa.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.480
Rebecca fought well.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:44.720
But Leon won and made the KC Grand Prix finals.

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:48.090
He'll face Sieg Lloyd, the one who beat Jonouchi.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.720
I wonder how they'll duel?

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:57.560
Kaiba Steps In!
Grand Prix Finals

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:34.000
Thru many victories, the two most powerful duelists have been chosen!

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:38.330
Introducing...

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:41.480
A Block winner, Sieg Lloyd!

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:48.250
B Block winner, Leon Wilson!

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:59.530
We'll now begin the KC Grand Prix's final match to determine who's the greatest duelist!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.920
What's that?

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:34.810
Huh?

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.020
Kaiba!

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.350
Kaiba!

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.560
Big brother!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:52.250
You're finally making your appearance.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.920
Stop right there!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:03.880
As this tournament's sponsor, I'm canceling this match!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.630
What's Kaiba talking about?

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.830
What's going on?

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.780
Canceled?

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:20.720
Leon Wilson wins by default, making him the KC Grand Prix's first king!

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:23.070
Huh?  Me?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.720
What's going on, Mokuba?

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:27.500
I don't know.

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:31.950
Please explain yourself, Mr. Kaiba.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.440
I don't need to explain.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:38.700
Because you know why, Sieg Lloyd-

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:43.280
Or should I say Siegfried von Schroeder?

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.570
Schroeder?

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:48.990
Grandpa, isn't Schroeder...

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:53.690
Yes.  Schroder Company is Europe's #1 game entertainment company.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:58.240
And top 5 in the world.

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:02.580
So it’s Kaiba Corporation's rival?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:11.460
Schroeder Company's heir enters Kaiba Corporation's tournament under a fake name.

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:16.830
At the same time, someone sabotages my amusement park.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.240
What?

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:31.540
I have a good idea what caused this, but I won’t bother investigating.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:39.610
But Siegfried, it’s clear that you falsified your name and background!

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:47.720
That’s enough to ban you from the finals!

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:59.350
So Kaiba Corporation's leader is a coward.

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:00.510
What?

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:10.620
You're scared that Schroeder Company's next president will be the KC Grand Prix's first champion.

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:16.550
Mr. Kaiba, our conversation is being broadcasted around the world.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.570
You know what the fans will think?

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:28.190
Seto Kaiba is scared of Siegfried, so he disqualified him due to a minor infraction.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.180
You misunderstand me.

00:06:34.180 --> 00:06:36.240
I never said I'll disqualify you.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:43.180
I’ll prove that against me, your power is insignificant!

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.640
Kaiba vs Sieg?

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.560
This is unexpected.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:54.000
You’ll take me on?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:58.860
Isn't this what you wanted, Siegfried?

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:00.970
Kaiba is dueling?

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:05.310
Of course!  There's no way my brother wouldn't duel!

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:06.700
Isono.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.630
What's wrong?  Scared?

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:21.460
Of course not.  I'm honored, Mr. Kaiba.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:34.130
The winner chooses who goes first.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.770
Tails.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.520
Then I choose heads.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:46.400
I win.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.690
Fate loves me.

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.240
Fate?  It's just a coin flip.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.120
Choose who goes first.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.890
I'll go second.

00:07:56.890 --> 00:07:58.120
Fine.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:29.280
Crush him, big brother!

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:31.160
Yugi!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.050
Leon!

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:36.920
I never thought this is how I’d end up dueling you.

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:40.900
But it's your dream to duel Yugi, right?

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:42.500
Yeah…

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.160
Then don’t worry about it.

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:50.690
No matter how you got here, you earned the right to duel Yugi.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.280
That’s right!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.060
I wanted to duel Yugi too, you know!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.940
S-Sorry.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:01.060
Kaiba is as confident as ever.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.400
But Sieg isn’t your everyday duelist.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.840
You’re right.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:11.780
Kaiba, as every duelist in the world watches...

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:18.200
...I’ll bury you and Kaiba Corporation forever, never to rise again.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:22.650
Siegfried, you won’t get your way.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:29.100
You’ll learn it's foolish to challenge me.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.060
Duel!

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:41.100
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:46.970
I summon X-Head Cannon in attack position!

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:51.580
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:53.920
My turn.  I draw.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:58.420
Kaiba, the overture to one’s fate doesn't always start in silence.

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:03.580
It may begin like a storm.

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:07.840
Such nonsense makes me sick.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.600
Continue the duel!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.060
Of course.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:17.460
My beautiful war maidens are eager to send you to Valhalla.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:21.600
I activate the spell card, Ride of the Valkyries from my hand.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:25.570
It Special Summons all Valkyries in my hand!

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:26.740
What?

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:32.740
Come out, Valkyrie Zweite, Valkyrie Erste and Valkyrie Dritte!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.700
Valkyrie Zweite’s effect activates!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.610
When it's summoned, it destroys one of your monsters.

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:49.540
Then Valkyrie Erste’s effect removes one of your monsters in your graveyard from play.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:54.160
And she can battle using that monster’s attack points this turn.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:56.480
I'm not done!

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:59.030
Valkyrie Dritte's effect activates!

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:04.970
It gains 100 attack points for every one of your monsters removed from play.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.990
He already has three Valkyries!

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:10.670
Kaiba has no monsters to defend with.

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:14.920
If those three attack him directly, Kaiba will lose.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:16.360
Big brother!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:20.460
I didn't expect to reach the finale before the overture ended.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.040
Farewell, Kaiba.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.550
Go to Valhalla!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:27.630
First, Valkyrie Zweite attacks you directly!

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.690
I flip over my set card!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:50.020
Negate Attack!

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:53.970
It negates your attack and ends the Battle Phase!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:12:03.000
Nice!  Monsters summoned by Ride of the Valkyries return to the deck at the end of the turn.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.810
That was a short overture.

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:08.440
C'mon!

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:11.370
Have those maidens retreat!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:19.850
What’s that?

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:22.900
Kaiba, the overture has ended.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:26.250
We're now in the first movement.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:29.720
Valkyrie Zweite, attacks him directly!

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:30.670
What?

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:32.760
What's going on?

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:36.250
The Valkyries should've returned to his deck!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.360
Kaiba!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.700
You skipped a turn!

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:47.130
Yes.  My Quick-Play Spell, Mischief of the Time Goddess's effect.

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:52.210
I skip one turn, making it my Battle Phase again.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:58.850
Big brother!

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:03.660
I flip over my set card, Magical Trick Mirror!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:09.100
It lets me activate a spell card in your graveyard!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.540
I activate Mischief of the Time Goddess!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:13.710
What?

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.080
Kaiba!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:25.950
By skipping Sieg’s turn, it's now Kaiba's Battle Phase.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:31.340
I have no monsters on my field, so I can’t attack during this Battle Phase.

00:13:31.340 --> 00:13:36.060
But I can summon a new monster during my Main Phase.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.480
I summon Z-Metal Tank in defense position!

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:46.960
And I Special Summon Clone Dragon from my hand in defense position!

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:55.080
I can Special Summon it when I successfully summon a monster.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:58.350
It becomes a clone of the that monster!

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:03.890
I end my turn.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:11.260
Wow!  This duel's only started, but it's already a fierce battle!

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:15.030
But I think Kaiba’s on the losing end.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:20.640
He still has three Valkyries on his field.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:23.900
Don't think you survived, Kaiba.

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:27.300
By skipping the End Phase of my first turn…

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:31.410
...my Valkyries can remain on my field instead of retreating.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:35.020
It seems my war maidens don’t want to leave you.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:39.630
How scary.  Just draw your card!

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:41.500
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.380
I activate Valkyrie's Embrace from my hand!

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:49.890
And switch Valkyrie Dritte to defense position!

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.570
What?

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:58.370
By switching a Valkyrie to defense position...

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.810
...Valkyrie's Embrace remove one of your monsters from play!

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:11.950
Since another monster is removed from play, Valkyrie Dritte gains 100 attack points!

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:15.060
I'll bury that fake!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:19.030
Valkyrie Erste attacks Clone Dragon!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:25.990
And Valkyrie Zweite attacks you directly!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.480
Big brother!

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.250
Kaiba…

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.590
So this is all of Sieg's skills.

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:39.090
No, he’s just getting started.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.520
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:48.200
You don't seem worried.  Or is it just an act?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:53.170
I won't react to each of your lame attacks.

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:57.610
I summon Pitch-Dark Dragon from my hand in defense position!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.000
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:06.080
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:11.610
I switch Valkyrie Dritte from defense to attack position!

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:15.880
Valkyrie Zweite attacks Pitch-Dark Dragon!

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:21.540
Kaiba lost another monster.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.200
Will he be okay?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.630
Knowing Kaiba, he must have a plan.

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:30.360
I flip over my set card, Flat Lv 4!

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:34.430
It activates when a monster is destroyed.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:40.450
We both can Special Summon a Level 4 monster from our decks.

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:44.620
I Special Summon Y-Dragon Head in defense position!

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:51.050
I Special Summon Valkyrie Dritte in attack position.

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:56.260
Two monsters have been removed from play, so it gains 200 attack points.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:17:00.560
Thanks for inviting another war maiden, Kaiba.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:02.190
I end my turn.

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:04.530
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:07.630
I activate Pot of Greed from my hand!

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.440
I draw two cards from my deck.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:13.690
I activate Dimension Fusion from my hand.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:16.510
By paying 2000 life points…

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:21.450
...we can Special Summon monsters that were removed from play!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.120
What?  No way!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.120
I see!  An X, Y, Z combo!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.590
But it cost 2000 life points.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:30.060
He paid too much.

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:34.230
I activate the Continuous Spell, Soul Absorption from my hand!

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:41.170
Every time a card is removed from play, I regain 500 life points.

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:49.860
I remove X-Head Cannon, Y-Dragon Head and Z-Metal Tank from play...

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:56.430
...to combine them and summon XYZ-Dragon Cannon!

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.400
Impressive.

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:07.940
He used XYZ-Dragon Cannon's summoning requirements to minimize Dimension Fusion's cost.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:13.300
Kaiba can do this strategy because he knows everything about Duel Monsters.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.970
Here I go, you fake duelist!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:21.140
XYZ-Dragon Cannon attacks Valkyrie Dritte!

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:24.050
Hyper Destruction!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.940
You did it, big brother!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.210
Wow!  He made a comeback in just one turn!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.620
That's why he's Kaiba!

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:39.180
That's why he's Kaiba...

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.040
That’s why he's Seto Kaiba!

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:45.230
He's revolutionizing game entertainment!

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:48.340
He truly is a genius.

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:03.880
I was just a step too late...

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:09.320
Kaiba...

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:14.190
Sieg's expression has changed.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:19.130
My turn.  I draw.

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:22.870
I activate Nibelung's Treasure from my hand.

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:28.020
Jonouchi, that's the card he used in your duel.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:31.310
Yeah, it's that annoying ring.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:37.990
I take Nibelung's Ring from my deck, place it on your field and equip it on XYZ-Dragon Cannon.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:40.990
And I draw five cards.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:49.090
And you no longer control the monster equipped with Nibelung's Ring.

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:51.220
That’s not all.

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:54.380
Kaiba is forced to draw two cards next turn.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:59.210
If he draws a monster card, he'll have to send one to the graveyard.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:05.660
I tribute Valkyrie Dritte to summon Fortune Chariot.

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:15.420
What?

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:37.040
Once per turn, Fortune Chariot can equip on to a Valkyrie.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:46.840
And by halving the equipped monster's attack points, it can attack you directly.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.260
Oh no...

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:53.690
Valkyrie Zweite attacks you directly!

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:00.300
Big brother!

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:09.510
Kaiba!

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:10.990
I'm not done.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:14.570
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Mystical Space Typhoon from my hand!

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:19.920
Soul Absorption is destroyed.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:23.860
I set one card and end my turn.

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:28.300
Soul Absorption is destroyed, so you can’t regain life points.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:34.960
And as long as I have Fortune Chariot, I can keep attacking you directly.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:39.840
Kaiba, the Valkyries' curse is just getting started.

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:12.930
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:28.650
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:29.370 --> 00:22:34.490
Without a goal in mind

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:43.060
We just step towards our dream

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:48.700
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:48.890 --> 00:22:57.170
Your eye will find it

00:22:57.530 --> 00:23:02.980
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:11.120
Will touch your soul

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:14.380
In a duel

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:29.480
Sieg is the president of Kaiba's rival company?

00:23:29.480 --> 00:23:36.820
Kaiba took over for the finals, but Sieg's Goddess Deck is powerful!

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:42.230
Due to the Valkyries' attacks, Kaiba is in a pinch!

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:47.630
And Sieg is using the three Goddess combo that punished Jonouchi!

00:23:47.630 --> 00:23:51.440
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Valkyrie vs Blue-Eyes White Dragon

00:23:51.440 --> 00:23:52.950
Duel, standby!
